<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss National Bank denies Monday meeting rumour.</title>
<headline>Swiss National Bank denies Monday meeting rumour.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) is not planning a special meeting on Monday after French elections, an SNB spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is no special SNB board meeting on Monday, June 2,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Rumours of such a meeting had cropped up in non-Swiss markets on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial,+41 1 631 7340</p>
